<h2>HTML Tables</h2>
<ul>
<li>HTML Tables are defined in <code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;table&gt;=
</code> tag.</li>
<li>Table row should be defined in <code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;tr&gt=
;</code> tag</li>
<li>Table header should be defined in <code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;th=
&gt;</code> tag</li>
<li>Table data should be defined in <code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;td&g=
t;</code> tag</li>
<li>Table caption should be defined in <code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;c=
aption&gt;</code> tag</li>
</ul>
<h2>HTML-Javascript</h2>
<ul>
<li>Javascript is used in HTML pages to make them more interactive.</li>
<li><code node=3D"[object Object]">&lt;script&gt;</code> is the tag used to=
 write scripts in HTML</li>
<li>You can either reference a external script or write script code in this=
 tag.</li>
</ul>
